# The table editor, the game played in it (tests/t1/pinball3d_editor.sh), window 1440x900.
# V shows the table in 3D beside the top view, which gets narrower and shows the whole table again.
4 key v
# B, then a click on the top view above the first bumper (17.5, 20 cm): a ball is dropped there, and the game plays it.
8 key b
10 move 519 288
11 down
12 up
# P pauses the game and O steps it by a frame, twice; W opens the game's own window; P lets the game go on.
40 key p
44 key o
46 key o
50 key w
60 key p
# Escape ends the game: the table is at rest again.
150 key Escape
